# Fabric's game directory is not here: the renderReferences run config sets runDir to
# ../cache/run, which the repo root's own `cache/` rule already covers at any depth.
# Loom still creates an empty run/resources/ beside this file whatever runDir says, and
# git does not track an empty directory, so nothing is hidden by leaving it unignored -
# whereas a run/ that fills with config/, mods/ and logs/ means the runDir setting was
# lost, and that is precisely the case worth seeing in git status.

# Java crash + flight recorder
hs_err_*.log
replay_*.log
*.hprof
*.jfr
